  "worked_solution": "First, we distribute the $(-4)$ over each of the terms in parentheses.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}2u+(5u+v)\\cdot (-4) & = \\\\ 2u+5u\\cdot (-4)+v\\cdot (-4) & = \\\\ 2u+(-20u)+(-4v) & = \\\\ 2u-20u-4v & .\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we collect like terms.\n\n \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2u-20u-4v & = \\\\ (2u-20u)-4v & = \\\\ -18u-4v & \\end{aligned}\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
